    "detailed_description": "&quot;Magic Tower (Destroy the Wormhole)&quot; is a tower-climbing fixed-value strategy RPG game.<br />\r\nThe alien devils light-years away invaded the human planet through the wormhole. The human alliance sent the chosen warrior to climb to the top of the magic tower to destroy the invasion channel of the devils, and the warrior is the role played by the player.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features<br />\r\n\u00b7 The number of levels is moderate. For experienced players, the overall clearance time is about 4 hours<br />\r\n\u00b7 Only need to acquire a specific item once to display all secret passages<br />\r\n\u00b7 Over 40 unique monsters<br />\r\n\u00b7 7 unique scripture, you can also obtain powerful skills after successful cultivation<br />\r\n\u00b7 Some weapons provide specific skills<br />\r\n\u00b7 Use Gold Attack to instantly kill most types of monsters, and it is a solution when encountering difficulties",
